c source/matching/game/s20/s20_adjust_c.c
w3d_s20_dispatch_temp_801a5cb0|0x801a5cb0|Appears to build a temporary record from a linked record of the item and pass it to virtual method 19 of the secondary base subobject.
w3d_s20_dispatch_temp_801a5d18|0x801a5d18|Appears to build a temporary record from a linked record and the item address plus 24, then pass it to virtual method 19 of the secondary base subobject.
w3d_s20_dispatch_temp_801a5d88|0x801a5d88|Appears to build a temporary record from a linked record and the item byte at offset 24, then pass it to virtual method 19 of the secondary base subobject.
w3d_s20_attach_record_80168e28|0x80168e28|Appears to link an item record into the secondary base subobject and set or clear a flag bit depending on whether the record has a link.
w3d_s20_apply_item_mode_801d5730|0x801d5730|Appears to clear a base field, call a helper, then update two flag bits of the item from the base subobject state and return the helper result.
w3d_s20_apply_item_mode_801d567c|0x801d567c|Appears to clear a base field, call a helper and, when it does not fail, update two flag bits of the item from the base state.
w3d_s20_handle_item_target_801aaee8|0x801aaee8|Appears to dispatch an item's target through a handler table of the secondary base subobject with a field cleared meanwhile, then call a helper.
w3d_s20_apply_item_mode_801d59d0|0x801d59d0|Appears to clear a base field, call a helper and, when it does not fail, update two flag bits of the item from the base state.
